{"seq":3,"slug":"debugging-balancing-abilities","title":"调试与平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/gameplay-ability-systems/practice/debugging-balancing-abilities","wordCount":1341,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"调试与平衡\">调试与平衡</h1><p>一个技能上线后会用两种方式「坏掉」：一种是它不生效——玩家按了没反应，或者命中了却没扣血，这是正确性问题；另一种是它太强或太弱——数据上碾压或被无视，这是平衡问题。这两类问题的排查方法完全不同，但都因为技能系统层层叠叠（激活→条件→效果→属性→网络）而难定位。本篇给出这两条诊断链路，把「玄学不生效」和「拍脑袋调平衡」都变成可观测、可度量的工程问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>技能「不生效」的排查，关键是沿着它的执行链路逐段确认在哪一环断了。GAS 提供 <code>showdebug abilitysystem</code> 控制台命令，在屏幕上实时显示某单位当前的属性值、生效中的效果、拥有的标签、激活中的技能——这是诊断的第一站。整条链路与它的常见断点如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Input[&quot;输入未到达?&lt;br/&gt;查 InputTag 绑定&quot;] --&gt; Act[&quot;TryActivate&quot;]&#10;  Act --&gt; Can{&quot;CanActivate 失败?&quot;}&#10;  Can --&gt;|被阻断标签| T[&quot;查 showdebug: 是否有眩晕/沉默标签&quot;]&#10;  Can --&gt;|消耗不足| C[&quot;查属性: 法力够不够&quot;]&#10;  Can --&gt;|在冷却| CD[&quot;查标签: Cooldown.* 是否还在&quot;]&#10;  Can --&gt;|通过| Exec[&quot;效果施加&quot;]&#10;  Exec --&gt; GE{&quot;GE 没改属性?&quot;}&#10;  GE --&gt;|标签门槛拦截| TR[&quot;目标带免疫标签?&quot;]&#10;  GE --&gt;|量级为0| Mag[&quot;SetByCaller/曲线 取值对吗&quot;]&#10;  GE --&gt; Net{&quot;联网下客户端没反应?&quot;}&#10;  Net --&gt;|复制模式| RM[&quot;Mixed/Minimal 漏复制?&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  Input[\"输入未到达?&lt;br/&gt;查 InputTag 绑定\"] --&gt; Act[\"TryActivate\"]\n  Act --&gt; Can{\"CanActivate 失败?\"}\n  Can --&gt;|被阻断标签| T[\"查 showdebug: 是否有眩晕/沉默标签\"]\n  Can --&gt;|消耗不足| C[\"查属性: 法力够不够\"]\n  Can --&gt;|在冷却| CD[\"查标签: Cooldown.* 是否还在\"]\n  Can --&gt;|通过| Exec[\"效果施加\"]\n  Exec --&gt; GE{\"GE 没改属性?\"}\n  GE --&gt;|标签门槛拦截| TR[\"目标带免疫标签?\"]\n  GE --&gt;|量级为0| Mag[\"SetByCaller/曲线 取值对吗\"]\n  GE --&gt; Net{\"联网下客户端没反应?\"}\n  Net --&gt;|复制模式| RM[\"Mixed/Minimal 漏复制?\"]</pre><h2 id=\"不生效的逐段诊断\">不生效的逐段诊断</h2><p>把上图翻成一份可执行的排查清单，按从前到后的顺序逐段排除，能覆盖绝大多数「技能不生效」工单：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>最可能的环节</th>\n<th>怎么查</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按键完全无反应</td>\n<td>输入未绑定到技能</td>\n<td>检查 InputTag→技能映射、技能是否已授予</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偶尔放不出</td>\n<td>CanActivate 被标签阻断</td>\n<td><code>showdebug</code> 看是否带眩晕/沉默标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提示资源不足</td>\n<td>消耗检查失败</td>\n<td>看当前法力/能量属性值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一直说在冷却</td>\n<td>Cooldown 标签未移除</td>\n<td>看 Cooldown GE 是否到期、是否被重复施加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命中了不扣血</td>\n<td>效果被标签门槛拦或量级为 0</td>\n<td>看目标是否带免疫标签、SetByCaller 量级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自己生效别人看不到</td>\n<td>复制模式不当</td>\n<td>检查 ASC 用了 Mixed/Minimal 是否漏复制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这条清单的价值在于把「为什么不生效」从猜测变成二分查找：每一段都有明确的观测点（属性值、标签集合、效果列表、复制模式），逐段确认就能锁定断点。它直接对应前面各章的机制——所以读懂<a href=\"../foundations/ability-lifecycle\">技能生命周期</a>的阶段、<a href=\"../effects-tags/gameplay-tags\">标签与状态查询</a>的门槛、<a href=\"networking-prediction\">网络同步与预测</a>的复制模式，正是高效调试的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平衡的度量-从-dps-到有效战力\">平衡的度量：从 DPS 到有效战力</h2><p>技能「太强/太弱」不能靠手感拍板，要用模型量化。最基础的度量是有效每秒伤害（eDPS），它把单次伤害、施法/前摇时间、冷却、命中率、暴击综合成一个可比数。一个简化模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>eDPS</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>crit</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>crit</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>hit</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>cast</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>cd</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{eDPS} = \\frac{D \\cdot (1 + p_{\\text{crit}} \\cdot (m_{\\text{crit}} - 1)) \\cdot p_{\\text{hit}}}{\\max(t_{\\text{cast}},\\, t_{\\text{cd}})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eDPS</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cast</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cd</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">crit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">crit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是基础伤害，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>crit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{crit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">crit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 暴击率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>crit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{crit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">crit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 暴击倍率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>hit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{hit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 命中率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>cast</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{cast}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cast</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 施法时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>cd</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{cd}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cd</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 冷却。把一组技能的 eDPS 拉到同一张表上，离群值（远高或远低）就是平衡嫌疑对象。但 eDPS 只是起点——控制类技能要换算「控制时长的价值」，治疗要换算「有效治疗量」，机动位移要估「站位收益」，这些更复杂的价值评估属于<a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/combat-balance/dps-power-evaluation\">经济与平衡</a>，本篇只负责把单个技能的输出参数从框架里取出来度量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用遥测把平衡从主观变客观\">用遥测把平衡从主观变客观</h2><p>理论 eDPS 是纸面值，玩家实战表现才是真相。一个技能纸面很强但「难命中、前摇长、容易被打断」，实战胜率可能很低；反之亦然。把技能的实战数据埋点上报——使用率、命中率、平均伤害、参与击杀率、玩家在带它时的胜率——再回看，才能发现纸面模型没捕捉到的问题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>遥测指标</th>\n<th>揭示的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>使用率极低</td>\n<td>技能太弱/太难用，无人选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用率极高且胜率高</td>\n<td>过强，需削弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命中率远低于预期</td>\n<td>判定/手感问题，非数值问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带它时胜率离群</td>\n<td>综合战力失衡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这条「埋点—回看—调参—再验」的闭环，与<a href=\"../../game-telemetry-analytics/applied/balance-difficulty-tuning\">遥测分析</a>的平衡难度调优篇是同一套方法论，只是本篇聚焦单个技能的指标，遥测 hub 讲数据管线与全局分析。调参后改的往往就是<a href=\"data-driven-authoring\">数据驱动配置</a>里的那些数值字段，热迭代让这个闭环可以高频运转。区分「数值问题」与「手感/判定问题」尤为关键：命中率异常该去查目标判定与手感，而非一味改伤害数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>技能有两类「坏掉」：不生效（正确性）与失衡（平衡），排查方法完全不同。</li>\n<li>不生效靠沿激活→条件→效果→属性→网络链路逐段二分，<code>showdebug abilitysystem</code> 是第一观测站。</li>\n<li>平衡先用 eDPS 等模型把单技能输出量化、找离群值，控制/治疗/位移需各自的价值换算。</li>\n<li>纸面值不等于实战，用遥测（使用率/命中率/胜率）把平衡从主观变客观，闭环回到数据配置调参。</li>\n<li>务必区分数值问题与手感/判定问题——命中率异常不该用改伤害来解。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：调试所需的生命周期与标签知识 → <a href=\"../foundations/ability-lifecycle\">技能生命周期</a>、<a href=\"../effects-tags/gameplay-tags\">标签与状态查询</a>；调参改的数值字段 → <a href=\"data-driven-authoring\">数据驱动配置</a>；联网不生效查复制模式 → <a href=\"networking-prediction\">网络同步与预测</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：技能战力的深度评估 → <a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/combat-balance/dps-power-evaluation\">经济与平衡 · DPS 与战力评估</a>；用数据驱动平衡难度 → <a href=\"../../game-telemetry-analytics/applied/balance-difficulty-tuning\">遥测分析 · 平衡与难度调优</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"调试与平衡","id":"调试与平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"不生效的逐段诊断","id":"不生效的逐段诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"平衡的度量：从 DPS 到有效战力","id":"平衡的度量-从-dps-到有效战力"},{"level":2,"text":"用遥测把平衡从主观变客观","id":"用遥测把平衡从主观变客观"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"数据驱动配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/gameplay-ability-systems/practice/data-driven-authoring"},"next":null}